{"at":"2026-02-26T21:43:43.619Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":769,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/update-account-information/","title":"Updating account/profile information","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>Updating account/profile information</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9644\" class=\"elementor elementor-9644\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e8e5a8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1e8e5a8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54f5f1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"54f5f1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:32\">Keeping your account information up-to-date is essential for ensuring that you have access to all of the features and benefits of PropertyList. It also helps to ensure that your contact information is accurate and that you receive important notifications from the platform.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5211a1d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5211a1d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4050d67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4050d67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Edit Contact Info</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1a3e3c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1a3e3c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here you can change your user password, platform language and notifications.<br>Log in to your PropertyList.es account and click on your USER NAME on the top right.</p><ul><li>Click “My Settings”</li></ul><p>To edit a staff members account:<br>Log in to your PropertyList.es account and click on the <strong>“STAFF”</strong>&nbsp;tab on the left.</p><ul><li>Select a staff member</li><li>Click edit</li><li>Here you can edit: name, phone, email, platform language and <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/managing-user-permissions-and-access-levels/\">user permissions.</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"Updating account/profile information • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}